000011DC                           245  *-----------------------------------------------------------
000011DC                           246  * Subroutine    : Game
000011DC                           247  * Description   : Game including main GameLoop. GameLoop is like
000011DC                           248  * a while loop in that it runs forever until interupted
000011DC                           249  * (Input, Update, Draw). The Enemies Run at Player Jump to Avoid
000011DC                           250  *-----------------------------------------------------------
000011DC                           251  GAME:
000011DC  6100 0340                252      BSR     PLAY_RUN                ; Play Run Wav
000011E0  6100 0396                253      BSR     PLAY_BACKGROUND
000011E4                           254  GAMELOOP:
000011E4                           255    
000011E4                           256      ; Main Gameloop
000011E4  6100 0014                257      BSR     INPUT                   ; Check Keyboard Input
000011E8  6100 0052                258      BSR     UPDATE                  ; Update positions and points
000011EC  6100 029A                259      BSR     IS_PLAYER_ON_GND        ; Check if player is on ground
000011F0  6100 04CE                260      BSR     CHECK_COLLISIONS        ; Check for Collisions
000011F4  6100 01DC                261      BSR     DRAW                    ; Draw the Scene
000011F8  60EA                     262      BRA     GAMELOOP                ; Loop back to GameLoop
